    "Synchronized generic whole-script semantic review, layered full-speech verification, complete-source acquisition, speaker-reference boundaries and bounded supervised service takeover.",
    "Historical task-specific continuations, editorial decisions and voice selections are public fail-closed adapters with no private registrations; unsupported present credentials are refused and ordinary manifest paths pass through unchanged.",
